# UI (MUI)

- Mobile-first: design for 375px viewport, then scale up (bottom nav mobile, sidebar desktop).
- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for interactivity.
- Use MUI theme tokens — avoid one-off magic spacing/colors.
- Component files: PascalCase under `app/` or `components/`.
- Accessibility: labels on inputs, keyboard reachability, sufficient contrast.
- No patient PII in browser console.
- Keep screens focused — one primary action per view in Phase 1.
